  { icon: '🥾', title: 'Hiking Etiquette', text: 'Say "hei" or "morn" when passing other hikers. Stay on marked trails in sensitive areas. Cairns mark the route — don\'t build new ones or knock them down. Close all farm gates behind you.' },
  { icon: '🤫', title: 'Norwegian Reserve', text: 'Norwegians are friendly but reserved with strangers. Don\'t sit next to someone on an empty bus. Small talk comes slowly but once the ice breaks, they\'re warm and generous.' },
